cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Dr. Morgan — UX Research Skills & Agents"
message: "If you use, adapt, or build on this suite, please cite it."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Hosic
    given-names: Kirsten
    affiliation: "IBM — UX Research Strategy Lead, Security Product Design"
repository-code: "https://github.com/kirstenhosic/UX-Research-Skills-IBM-Secure"
abstract: >-
  An invokable UX research mentor for IBM product teams, with a scenario router
  covering analysis, method selection, study planning, plan and discussion-guide
  critique, competitive analysis, and integrity-first qualitative analysis —
  plus seven independent evaluator agents that gate every drafted artifact for
  participant safety, plan soundness, discussion-guide quality, survey-instrument
  quality, groundedness, significance, and readability.
keywords:
  - ux-research
  - user-research
  - qualitative-analysis
  - discussion-guide
  - research-operations
  - llm-agents
  - evaluation
